<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - J.B. Hunt cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - J.B. Hunt cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co said analyst Steve Lewins downgraded J.B. Hunt Transport Services Inc to neutral from outperfrom-long term.</p>
<p>-- said it may take until 1999 for the company's turnaround &quot;to be fully achieved.&quot;</p>
<p>-- pruned 1997 earnings estimate to $0.85 per share from $1 to reflect temporary impact of mergers on the quality of rail intermodal service.</p>
<p>-- shares were up 1/8 to 14-3/8.</p>
</text>
